---
title: "Daily Operational Cycle"
---
gantt
    title Daily Agent Schedule (UK Time)
    dateFormat HH:mm
    axisFormat %H:%M

    section Market Intel
    Morning Job Scan           :mi1, 07:00, 15min
    Afternoon Job Scan         :mi2, 13:00, 15min
    Evening Job Scan           :mi3, 19:00, 15min

    section Coordinator
    Daily Planning & Briefing  :co1, 07:15, 20min
    Heartbeat Checks (every 2h) :co2, 07:30, 840min

    section App Tracker
    Pipeline Check 1           :at1, 08:00, 10min
    Pipeline Check 2           :at2, 12:00, 10min
    Pipeline Check 3           :at3, 16:00, 10min
    Pipeline Check 4           :at4, 20:00, 10min

    section On-Demand
    Materials Prep (if needed)  :crit, od1, 08:00, 60min
    Interview Prep (if triggered) :crit, od2, 09:00, 45min
    Company Research (if needed)  :od3, 10:00, 30min
